OL,3,GNEWSAThe retailers fighting shoplifting
OL,4,Aone social media post at a time
OL,5,
OL,6,FDisposable barbeques worth #120 gone in
OL,7,Fseconds. Piles of chocolate bars
OL,8,Fgrabbed. A small child in a balaclava,
OL,9,Ffleeing with fruit.
OL,11,FAs Erdogan Yigitoglu scrolls through
OL,12,Fhis videos, he points out some of the
OL,13,Fmost shocking examples of shoplifting
OL,14,Fhe has captured on his CCTV, some of
OL,15,Fwhich he has posted online.
OL,17,FFor six years, the Bournemouth
OL,18,Fconvenience shop owner has seen social
OL,19,Fmedia as his most effective weapon in
OL,20,Fhis fight against shoplifters, an issue
OL,21,Fhe says loses him thousands of pounds
OL,22,Fevery year.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
