OL,3,GNEWSAThe retailers fighting shoplifting
OL,4,Aone social media post at a time
OL,5,
OL,6,FYigitoglu has run his shop for 19
OL,7,Fyears, and he credits publicly shaming
OL,8,Fand banning shoplifters for a reduction
OL,9,Fin crime over the past few years.
